From ce18ffceb3af2ff6f744079187884e57793fda7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:00:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): show unsent session drafts above Recents
 [daveey]

Paint client-only main and tab draft rows below Pinned, with existing project placement, focus, preview titles and optimistic first-send replacement. Capture main draft cwd at creation so foreground project tiles cannot move it. Keep listed:false drafts out of backend lists and project snapshots.

Proof: regression null-render control and foreground-cwd mutant fail; focused draft and real main/tab send tests pass. Sidebar batch: 84 files / 1119 tests; expanded action consumers: 26 files / 363 tests. Desktop tsc --noEmit, applicable ESLint and scripts/check --base origin/main pass. Real hub-routed cwd-null sends already place the optimistic row at the top of Home before tree refresh, so no send-path production change is needed.
